1
00:00:00,553 --> 00:00:01,763
[LAUGHS]

2
00:00:01,929 --> 00:00:06,559
(Stuart:)But if you're dead set
on a comic book, try this.

3
00:00:06,726 --> 00:00:09,016
Oh. "Hellblazer. " What's this about?

4
00:00:09,187 --> 00:00:12,477
(Stuart:)A morally ambiguous confidence man
who smokes, has lung cancer...

5
00:00:12,648 --> 00:00:16,108
(Stuart:)...and is tormented
by the spirits of the undead.

6
00:00:16,277 --> 00:00:19,697
(Penny:)Well, if that doesn't make me
the favorite aunt, I don't know what will.

7
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,580
(Penny:)Is this me?

8
00:00:25,703 --> 00:00:26,913
(Stuart:)Depends. Do you like it?

9
00:00:27,497 --> 00:00:30,457
- Wow, it's really good.
- Yes, that's you.

10
00:00:32,585 --> 00:00:34,965
(Penny:)That's so sweet.
But what if I didn't like it?

11
00:00:35,129 --> 00:00:38,089
(Stuart:)It'd still be you, but I'd feel like an idiot.

12
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:42,930
(Leonard:)I don't believe it.
Stuart's putting the moves on Penny.

13
00:00:43,095 --> 00:00:45,885
(Howard:)I have got to learn how to draw.

14
00:00:46,849 --> 00:00:48,269
(Penny:)Hey.

15
00:00:48,434 --> 00:00:52,394
(Sheldon:)Once again, defeated
by your own prurient interests.

16
00:00:52,563 --> 00:00:55,773
(Raj:)Guys, have you seen Stuart all up
in Penny's business over there?

17
00:00:55,942 --> 00:01:00,032
(Leonard:)Nobody's up in anybody's business.
Let's just buy our stuff and go.

